{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d7e37bda-394d-80a5-b64c-2c56c636efc1",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T11:31:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Judith Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:23:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:23:46-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. This is Judith Peckham. I'm calling because a plow took out my mailbox, and I'd like somebody to come back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:23:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry to hear that, Mrs. Peckham. Let me grab some notes. Where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:24:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Seventeen Bridge Street. Down on the Point, a couple of houses up from the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:24:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Seventeen Bridge Street, the Point. Got it. And when did this happen? Was this the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:24:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The snow-to-rain one, Sunday into Monday. It was three days ago now. I found the mailbox Monday morning lying in the snowbank like it had given up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:24:44-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the post is knocked over, the box is down. Is it broken off at the base or just tipped?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:24:56-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Snapped off at the bottom. My nephew's not around, so it's sitting on the porch. I put it there so it wouldn't get run over a second time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:25:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Smart. And you said you wanted a plow to come back. Is that for the mailbox, or is the street itself still not cleared?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:25:26-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both, if I'm honest. They shoved a wall of heavy slush at the end of my driveway, and then it rained and froze. It's now about the consistency of concrete. I'm eighty-some years old. I don't shovel concrete."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:25:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, nobody should. So the end of the driveway has a hard ridge of plowed-in snow and ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:25:58-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the one. I'd like a plow to come back and at least take the top off it. I'm not asking for a miracle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:26:12-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put that in as a request for a return pass on Bridge Street. I should say, I can't tell you exactly when. Crews are still working through a lot of side streets after that storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I figured. Nobody ever says when. It's a tradition."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:26:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Fair enough. Let me write this down. Mailbox knocked over by a plow, Monday, seventeen Bridge Street. Did you see the plow do it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:26:53-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. I was in the kitchen having tea. I heard a scrape and a bang around six in the morning. By the time I got to the window it was gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:27:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so heard it, didn't see the truck. That's fine. Is the post wood or metal?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:27:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wood. Four-by-four. It's been there since before the Reagan administration. I wasn't sentimental about it until it fell over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:27:32-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'll note it as a wooden post, snapped. I'll flag this for whoever handles damage reports so they can look at it. Do you have a phone number in case they want to call you back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:27:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This one. It's the landline. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:27:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-eight. Got it. And it's Peckham, P-E-C-K-H-A-M?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:28:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Judith."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:28:07-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Judith Peckham. Okay. Meanwhile, if the mail carrier can't reach the box, it might be worth setting something temporary up. A lot of folks tape a bucket to a stake or something similar. The post office usually just wants a safe spot for them to reach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:28:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I might do that. I have a bucket. I don't have a stake. I have a very good umbrella, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:28:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Maybe hold off on the umbrella. Or at least wait till the weather settles."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:28:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good point. It's the only one I've got that doesn't turn inside out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:29:02-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So just to read it back. Seventeen Bridge Street, plow knocked over the mailbox Monday morning, and you'd like a plow to come back for the ice ridge at the end of the driveway. Anything else on the street? Is the whole block hard to get through?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:29:28-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street is passable. One car wide, but passable. It's the driveway end that bothers me. I have to go to a doctor's appointment next week and I'd rather not do it on a sheet of ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:29:49-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note the appointment next week so they know there's a reason to prioritize. I can't promise it moves you up the list, but it goes on the ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:30:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all I ask. The ticket. I like a ticket. Gives me something to look at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:30:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Anything else I can do for you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, no. Except, to be fair, the day isn't a complete loss. I got a new pair of slippers in the mail yesterday. Sheepskin lining. Very pleased with them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:30:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, nice. Those are a good thing in this weather."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:30:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They are the best part of the week so far. Which tells you something about the rest of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:30:55-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Yeah, I hear you. Okay, the request is in. Somebody from Public Works will either come out or call you at that number. If the mailbox damage gets looked at separately, they'll reach out about that too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:31:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. I'll be here. Not going anywhere. Can't, really. Driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:31:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Hang in there, Mrs. Peckham. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:31:28-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
